{"seq":2,"slug":"packaging-data-collection-declaration","title":"包装用量数据采集、归类与申报测算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-epr-registration/packaging-data-collection-declaration","wordCount":3000,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"包装用量数据采集-归类与申报测算\">包装用量数据采集、归类与申报测算</h1><p>一家跨境卖家在德国完成 LUCID 注册、签下系统参与合同之后，真正的麻烦才刚开始：注册只是&quot;报上门&quot;，而年度成本、市场占有率分摊、乃至是否被认定为&quot;低报&quot;（under-participation）都由<strong>申报的包装用量数字</strong>决定。这个数字错一个数量级，要么多缴几十万欧元回收费，要么被运营商的控制报告（control report）对不上而面临罚款。本文把&quot;数据从哪来—怎么归类—什么时间报—怎么对账&quot;这条链路拆开讲，因为它是 EPR 义务里唯一<strong>持续发生</strong>且<strong>直接换成钱</strong>的动作。义务主体切分见同章 <a href=\"../packaging-regulation-framework/obligation-role-responsibility-matrix\">义务主体、角色与责任矩阵</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一份数据-两个接收方\">核心概念：一份数据、两个接收方</h2><p>德国包装登记体系的申报逻辑可浓缩为一句话：<strong>报到系统运营商的那份报告，必须原样再报一份给 LUCID 包装登记处</strong>。ZSVR（Stiftung Zentrale Stelle Verpackungsregister）在其数据报告官方说明中写道：生产者在签订或续签合同时、按合同周期报告时、修正此前报告时、以及应运营商要求时都必须提交报告，且&quot;原则上同一份报告也必须提交给 LUCID&quot;（来源：ZSVR, Data reporting）。由此产生两个数字必须一致的角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>系统运营商（Systembetreiber）</strong>：实际收取回收费用、组织回收的一方。生产者先与它签合同，并按合同周期报送用量。</li>\n<li><strong>LUCID 包装登记处</strong>：由 ZSVR 运营的官方登记平台。生产者用注册号（LUCID registration number）录入同一批数据；LUCID 不单独发回执，但数据可在个人面板查看。</li>\n<li><strong>对账机制</strong>：运营商向 ZSVR 发送<strong>控制报告</strong>，ZSVR 把它与 LUCID 申报逐条比对，并据此计算各运营商的市场份额。&quot;只报运营商、不报 LUCID&quot;或&quot;两份数字不一致&quot;都会被系统自动发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>须区分的是，PPWR 层面的<strong>产品要求</strong>（可回收性、再生含量、标识）与 <strong>EPR 登记、申报与缴费</strong>是两条线：前者由 (EU) 2025/40 统一，后者仍在成员国国内法。适用范围判定见 <a href=\"../packaging-regulation-framework/ppwr-scope-applicability-timeline\">PPWR 适用范围、关键定义与实施时间表</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[SKU 包装清单&lt;br/&gt;物料 BOM] --&gt; B[单位包装重量&lt;br/&gt;按材料拆分]&#10;    B --&gt; C[乘以销往目标国的&lt;br/&gt;件数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[按材料类别汇总&lt;br/&gt;得到申报量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[报送系统运营商]&#10;    D --&gt; F[按同一数字&lt;br/&gt;报送 LUCID]&#10;    E --&gt; G[运营商控制报告]&#10;    G --&gt; H[ZSVR 比对&lt;br/&gt;与市场份额计算]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{是否一致?}&#10;    I --&gt;|不一致| J[低报 罚款 或&lt;br/&gt;补报修正]&#10;    I --&gt;|一致| K[费用结算&lt;br/&gt;与合规确认]\">flowchart TD\n    A[SKU 包装清单&lt;br/&gt;物料 BOM] --&gt; B[单位包装重量&lt;br/&gt;按材料拆分]\n    B --&gt; C[乘以销往目标国的&lt;br/&gt;件数]\n    C --&gt; D[按材料类别汇总&lt;br/&gt;得到申报量]\n    D --&gt; E[报送系统运营商]\n    D --&gt; F[按同一数字&lt;br/&gt;报送 LUCID]\n    E --&gt; G[运营商控制报告]\n    G --&gt; H[ZSVR 比对&lt;br/&gt;与市场份额计算]\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{是否一致?}\n    I --&gt;|不一致| J[低报 罚款 或&lt;br/&gt;补报修正]\n    I --&gt;|一致| K[费用结算&lt;br/&gt;与合规确认]</pre><h2 id=\"申报口径-材料类别与包装层级\">申报口径：材料类别与包装层级</h2><p>归类的第一问不是&quot;这包装有多重&quot;，而是&quot;它算不算、算哪一类&quot;。ZSVR 的系统参与判定标准是<strong>废弃物实际流向</strong>：只有在整体市场评估下<strong>主要随私人家庭或同类废弃物源</strong>产生的包装，才需系统参与并申报用量。所谓&quot;同类源&quot;包括餐厅、酒店、医院、食堂、学校、图书馆、游乐场，以及部分手工业企业和农业经营体——前提是废弃物按接近家庭的方式收集、每收集组容器不超过 1,100 升（来源：ZSVR, Catalogue search）。这条界线决定一件商业直邮包装是&quot;要缴费&quot;还是&quot;走另一条通道&quot;。</p>\n<p>归类到具体数字时，须沿三个维度切分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>切分维度</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>申报影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>材料类别</td>\n<td>纸/纸板/卡纸、塑料、铁质金属、铝、玻璃、饮料纸盒、其他复合材料</td>\n<td>决定费率档次与完整性声明门槛分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装层级</td>\n<td>销售包装（一次）、分组包装（二次）、运输包装（三次）</td>\n<td>决定是否纳入系统参与、复用目标是否适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>废弃物归属</td>\n<td>私人家庭 / 同类源 vs 工业或大型商业</td>\n<td>决定是否走系统参与通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>材料类别的粒度是第一道坎。ZSVR 申报说明举出的材料示例为&quot;纸、纸板与卡纸，塑料，铁质金属和玻璃&quot;等（来源：ZSVR, Data reporting）。一个高频错误是<strong>复合包装不拆分</strong>：饮料纸盒由纸板、聚乙烯和铝箔复合而成，若整件按&quot;纸&quot;申报，就会拉低铝与塑料量，在完整性声明核对中暴露为低报。正确做法是按材料<strong>质量占比</strong>估算各层重量再分别归类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据采集-从-sku-清单到单位重量\">数据采集：从 SKU 清单到单位重量</h2><p>数据的源头不是供应商发票，而是<strong>你自己可控的包装清单（packaging BOM）</strong>。同一 SKU 可能在不同工厂、不同批次使用不同包装，因此需为每个 SKU 维护一份&quot;包装构成表&quot;，记录每件包装物的材料、单位重量与投放环节。采集路径有三条，可靠性递减：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>称重实测</strong>：对代表性样品用精度到 0.1 g 的天平称重，剥离各层材料分别称。这是唯一能支撑完整性声明的口径，应作基准。</li>\n<li><strong>供应商规格书</strong>：索取克重（g/m²）、厚度、密度，用面积与密度反算重量，适合实测前的估算。</li>\n<li><strong>行业标准重量</strong>：协会或运营商提供的平均单位重量，仅适合快速估算，<strong>不建议</strong>作最终申报口径，因为无法反映你实际的轻量化或加重设计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按材料汇总服从一个求和公式。设销往目标国的 SKU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 件，每件中材料 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的重量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{i,m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（千克），则该材料总申报量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_m = \\sum_{i} n_i \\cdot w_{i,m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若某层由面积、密度与厚度推算，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{i,m} = A_m \\cdot \\rho_m \\cdot t_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该材料面积（m²），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为面密度（g/m²），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为层数或等效厚度系数；乘积为克，须除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 转为千克。另有两个易忽略的约束：数据须按<strong>投放市场的期间</strong>归集而非下单/发货期间，用保税仓、海外仓分批入仓时要把&quot;入仓时点&quot;与&quot;销售时点&quot;分别记账；用量以千克为单位、保留到小数点后第三位（来源：ZSVR, Data reporting）——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.234</mn><mtext> kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.234\\ \\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.234</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 合规，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.23</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1234</mn><mtext> g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1234\\ \\text{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1234</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span> 都不行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申报周期-截止日与完整性声明\">申报周期、截止日与完整性声明</h2><p>申报频率由<strong>生产者与系统运营商的合同约定</strong>（常见月度/季度/年度）；若未约定区间，至少要申报<strong>年度计划用量</strong>（planned volume）。但几个法定时点不可错过：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>截止时点</th>\n<th>申报内容</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>当年 12 月 31 日</td>\n<td>次年<strong>计划用量</strong>（首次计划申报）</td>\n<td>ZSVR Data reporting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次年 6 月 1 日</td>\n<td>上一年<strong>实际用量</strong>的年终报告</td>\n<td>ZSVR Data reporting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次年 6 月 1 日</td>\n<td>首次低于 10 吨者的简化单次年终报告</td>\n<td>ZSVR Data reporting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次年 5 月 15 日</td>\n<td>大批量生产者的<strong>完整性声明</strong>（审计版）</td>\n<td>ZSVR Declaration of completeness</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>完整性声明（Vollständigkeitserklärung）</strong> 是申报体系的&quot;审计关卡&quot;。触发门槛是上一年度<strong>达到或超过任一阈值</strong>：玻璃 80 吨、纸/纸板/卡纸 50 吨、轻质包装合计 30 吨（涵盖铁质金属、铝、塑料、饮料纸盒及其他复合材料）。它必须在<strong>5 月 15 日前</strong>提交且<strong>不可延期</strong>，由三部分组成：LUCID 生成的&quot;生产者声明&quot;、审计师的审计确认、审计师的审计报告。审计须由在 LUCID 注册的专家、审计师、税务顾问或宣誓会计师完成，且生产者须在指定审计方<strong>之前</strong>就与其存在合同关系；生产者声明与审计确认都需用<strong>合格电子签名</strong>（qualified electronic signature）签署（来源：ZSVR, Declaration of completeness）。口径的跨年变化需留意：<strong>自 2026 参考年度起</strong>，审计师须提交<strong>统一格式声明</strong>——表单遵循新《包装法实施法》（VerpackDG），实质内容仍以原《包装法》（VerpackG）为准，通常申报日为 2027 年 5 月 15 日。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的规则切换-verpackdg-与-ppwr-同时换轨\">2026 年的规则切换：VerpackDG 与 PPWR 同时换轨</h2><p>2026 年 8 月 12 日是这条链路的结构性换轨点。当日，欧盟 <strong>PPWR（(EU) 2025/40）</strong> 正式适用，Directive 94/62/EC 大体废止；同日，德国**《包装法实施法》（VerpackDG）** 取代原《包装法》，与 PPWR 一起生效（来源：ZSVR, &quot;What changed on 12 August 2026&quot;；欧盟委员会包装与包装废弃物专题页）。PPWR 本身自 2025 年 2 月 11 日已生效，委员会 2026 年 3 月发布实施指南，2026 年 8 月发布常见问题（FAQ）。换轨对&quot;报什么、谁来报&quot;有三处直接影响：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>义务拆成两个角色</strong>：<strong>制造商（manufacturer）</strong> 负责包装合规（技术文档、合规声明），<strong>生产者（producer）</strong> 承担 EPR（出资回收、登记与申报）。品牌优先原则下，使用自有名称或品牌的公司一般两者兼具。</li>\n<li><strong>境外直邮卖家须指定授权代表</strong>：无德国分支机构的境外公司若直接向德国终端用户销售已包装商品，须为其德国 EPR 义务指定<strong>授权代表（authorised representative）</strong>。欧盟层面该义务仍有变动：委员会 2025 年 12 月提出环境综合简化方案拟暂停跨境直售的授权代表义务，截至 2026 年仍在议会与理事会审议——<strong>申报安排应为此过渡期不确定性预留缓冲。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>非系统参与包装将需审批</strong>：对不属于系统参与的包装，生产者或其他生产者责任组织自 <strong>2027 年底</strong> 起需要 ZSVR 授权，并设有过渡期与费用安排。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>换轨并未取消登记、系统参与与数据报告三项基本义务，但重划了&quot;谁必须报&quot;，因此 2026 年尤其要重新核对义务主体，而不是沿用旧台账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申报测算与对账-偏差从哪里来\">申报测算与对账：偏差从哪里来</h2><p>申报数字与真实用量的偏差几乎总来自四个可预测的来源，做成固定的月度检查项即可把低报风险压到最低。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差来源</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n<th>修正动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复合包装未拆层</td>\n<td>铝、塑料被并入&quot;纸&quot;</td>\n<td>按质量占比拆层，重算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{i,m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>件数口径错误</td>\n<td>用订单件数代替投放件数</td>\n<td>以实际进入目标国市场的件数为准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材料标签错配</td>\n<td>生物基塑料按&quot;纸&quot;申报</td>\n<td>按材料属性而非外观归类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修正时序颠倒</td>\n<td>先改 LUCID、后通知运营商</td>\n<td>必须先通知运营商，再把确认后的量报 LUCID</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>修正（correction）的顺序被 ZSVR 明确固定：<strong>生产者必须先向系统运营商通报调整后的用量，待运营商确认后，再将确认的数字报送 LUCID</strong>。年内做的调整按&quot;年内用量报告&quot;（intra-year volume report）提交；自然年或预测年度结束后的调整按&quot;年终用量报告&quot;提交（来源：ZSVR, Data reporting）。对账的终点是 ZSVR 的比对：运营商提交的控制报告与生产者的 LUCID 申报对照，差异会成为低报认定的依据并影响市场份额计算。因此提交前应做一次内部逐项比对，确认三者——<strong>你的台账、运营商的合同数字、LUCID 的申报数字</strong>——完全一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>骨架是&quot;<strong>一份数据、两个接收方</strong>&quot;：报运营商的那份必须原样再报 LUCID，ZSVR 用控制报告对账并计算市场份额。</li>\n<li>归类第一问是废弃物<strong>实际流向</strong>（私人家庭/同类源 vs 工业商业），第二问才是材料类别与包装层级；ZSVR 产品目录不穷尽，存疑须自行分类或申请分类裁定。</li>\n<li>数据源优先级 <strong>称重实测 &gt; 供应商规格书 &gt; 行业标准重量</strong>；汇总服从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_m = \\sum_i n_i \\cdot w_{i,m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，录入精度为千克保留三位小数。</li>\n<li>法定时点：次年计划用量 <strong>12 月 31 日</strong>、年终实际用量 <strong>6 月 1 日</strong>、完整性声明 <strong>5 月 15 日且不可延期</strong>；门槛为玻璃 80 吨、纸类 50 吨、轻质包装合计 30 吨。</li>\n<li>修正次序不可颠倒——<strong>先通知运营商，再报 LUCID</strong>；设计侧要求见 <a href=\"../packaging-design-recyclability/recyclability-grading-design-criteria\">可回收性分级与设计准则</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包装用量数据采集、归类与申报测算","id":"包装用量数据采集-归类与申报测算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一份数据、两个接收方","id":"核心概念-一份数据-两个接收方"},{"level":2,"text":"申报口径：材料类别与包装层级","id":"申报口径-材料类别与包装层级"},{"level":2,"text":"数据采集：从 SKU 清单到单位重量","id":"数据采集-从-sku-清单到单位重量"},{"level":2,"text":"申报周期、截止日与完整性声明","id":"申报周期-截止日与完整性声明"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的规则切换：VerpackDG 与 PPWR 同时换轨","id":"2026-年的规则切换-verpackdg-与-ppwr-同时换轨"},{"level":2,"text":"申报测算与对账：偏差从哪里来","id":"申报测算与对账-偏差从哪里来"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"EPR 注册与包装登记号生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-epr-registration/epr-registration-identifier-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"EPR 费用核算、对账与审计应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-epr-registration/epr-fee-reconciliation-audit"}}